Historical flavor events for Finland, from 1936 to the end of the Winter War in March 1940. Each event is drawn from a sourced moment of the period, from politics and the economy to sport, culture and the defence of the country. Most show a photograph; the rest use the game's own event art. The events leave vanilla Finland's own focuses and events alone. Inspired by the old "Third Reich Events" mod.

